Project Maya gfx906 support for v1.1.25 (94878e2).

Sources:
- Upstream PR: https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/397
  Patch URL: https://github.com/mw00/project-maya/pull/397.patch
  Author: nicholas631
  Pinned head: f7ac3edac51973573af331efed427266ddf7c88e
  Includes wave64 registration, native signed dot4 and the logical-warp
  regression test. Documentation and validation reports are omitted.
- Local additions: ML-gfx906 project-maya/build-context/patch/v1.1.24.patch
  Retain gfx906 in maya.py's installer device list and preserve signed zero
  in src/kernels/cuda/glm_lat8.cuh on Vega20.

